{"sourceUrl":"https://www7.zzu.edu.cn/kgxy/info/1013/5667.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:07.062209+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www7.zzu.edu.cn/kgxy/info/1013/5667.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<h1><br/></h1>\n<p><span><span>为进一步提升研究生生源质量、优化生源结构</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span>2027<span>年郑州大学考古与文化遗产学院计划接收推荐免试研究生。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、报名条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>凡已取得或预计可取得所在本科毕业学校推荐免试资格的应届本科毕业生均可报名。我院将及时审核预报名申请信息，并根据考生填报信息及提交的材料，择优选择符合条件的考生进行复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、招收专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>学术型研究生</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span><span>考古学</span>060100</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>专业型研究生</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span><span>博物馆</span>065100</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span><span>文物</span>145100</span></p>\n<p><span><span>注：最终招生专业以研招网推免系统公布专业目录为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、材料提交要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>考生按</span>1-7<span>的顺序将下列材料</span></span><span><span>合并</span></span><span><span>成一个</span>PDF<span>文档，并以</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>报考专业</span><span>-</span></span><span><span>手机</span></span><span><span>号码</span></span><span>”<span>的方式命名，如：</span><span>“</span><span>张三</span><span>-</span><span>考古学</span><span>-1</span></span><span>XX</span><span>XXXXXXXX”<span>，于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span><span>12:00</span><span>前扫描下</span></span><span><span>方</span></span><span><span>二维码填写预报名信息</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>在</span></span><span><span>表单最后</span></span><span><span>上传整合完毕的</span>PDF<span>文档。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>考生亲笔签名的《</span><span>2027</span><span>年郑州大学推免预报名申请表》（模板见附件</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>身份证正反面；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>加盖院系公章或学校教务部门公章的在校学习成绩单（前六个学期）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>郑州大学研究生复试考生政审表（应届考生）（模板见附件</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.<span>外语水平证明（大学英语四级、六级考试，托福，雅思，</span><span>PETS</span><span>等证书或成绩单）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6.<span>有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作等（没有可不提供）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7.<span>如在校期间从事课外科研活动中有突出表现的，提交由学校出具的证明材料（加盖教务处或学生处公章</span></span><span><span>，无相关经历可不提供</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www7.zzu.edu.cn/__local/D/71/82/6CA3F1B14FBD984468119C56032_A48FFECA_1EA63.png\"/></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、面试工作安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>面试方式：线上面试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>面试时间：学院将结合推免工作进度安排线上面试，具体时间、流程将在 </span><span>QQ </span><span>群通知（群号：</span><span>1125120497</span><span>，申请进群请备注：推免本科学校 </span><span>+ </span><span>报考专业 </span><span>+ </span><span>姓名）。完成预报名并上传材料的考生请务必加入 </span><span>QQ </span><span>群，密切关注群内各项通知。全国研招网推免系统开放时间以教育部公布为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、其他注意事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>全国推免服务系统（预计</span><span>9</span><span>月中下旬）开放后，已具有推免资格的考生，须在系统中注册并填报志愿，根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、待录取通知等相应程序。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>咨询电话：</span><span>0371-67781355</span><span>；联系人：王老师。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考古与文化遗产学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"0a291a7ea7c69052e9a0214b80a9cc21ad9eea426fb5bbc2ae7fd37770b89442","textLength":891,"sourceSha256":"18dfc896ce63e89d19abb228d57bc32ee524d6f51546dcc26e03d21786a7e456","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1 2027年郑州大学推免预报名申请表.doc","url":"https://www7.zzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1992489124&wbfileid=18207982"},{"name":"附件2 郑州大学研究生复试考生政审表.doc","url":"https://www7.zzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1992489124&wbfileid=18207983"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-13776da75c374a5a28fa","title":"2026年郑州大学考古与文化遗产学院关于2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:07.062209+00:00"}
